            <ArticleTitle>Genome Sequence of Grapevine Virus K, a Novel Vitivirus Infecting Grapevine.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e00994-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.00994-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Here, we report the genome sequence of grapevine virus K (GVK), a novel single-stranded RNA virus identified from a transcriptome of grapevine. The genome of GVK is 7,476 nucleotides in length and encodes 5 open reading frames. GVK is a putative member of the genus Vitivirus in the family Betaflexiviridae.</AbstractText>
